#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/operations.md:1 a68b780a05b54689aced361d26792ca3
msgid "Operations and contribution"
msgstr "Exploitation et contribution"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/operations.md:3 40c2a81ca1e645109860622360acc477
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Configuration"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/operations.md:5 6efcc7653d264366a0b85ec575009c44
msgid ""
"Keep secrets outside documentation and source control. Use `.env.example` as"
" the public contract and store real values only in the designated local "
"settings surface."
msgstr ""
"Gardez les secrets hors de la documentation et du controle de source. "
"Utilisez `.env.example` comme contrat public et stockez les valeurs reelles "
"uniquement dans la surface locale designee."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/operations.md:7 64937be012c44a1089efda99c401afe1
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "Tests"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/operations.md:9 fc8eb028156b44159c03295cba29b811
msgid ""
"Run the repository checks listed in the quickstart. A passing narrow test "
"does not prove unrelated interfaces or scientific claims."
msgstr ""
"Executez les controles du depot listes dans le demarrage rapide. La reussite"
" d'un test borne ne prouve ni les interfaces non liees ni des affirmations "
"scientifiques."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/operations.md:11 69b5232a637c47faa355c4b54ab5b6b3
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Depannage"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/operations.md:13 b7cec9debc3649d3a01bb09e66d6dfc1
msgid "Confirm the repository and branch."
msgstr "Confirmez le depot et la branche."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/operations.md:14 b6c492d0434e438d8f94654b66611900
msgid "Reproduce with the smallest supported input."
msgstr "Reproduisez avec la plus petite entree prise en charge."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/operations.md:15 89e034d58cae4c8e889034481a06066b
msgid "Capture the exact command and error."
msgstr "Consignez la commande et l'erreur exactes."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/operations.md:16 399cdbd8fc1b4bf698e0453e13439a1a
msgid "Check the documented runtime and lockfile."
msgstr "Verifiez le runtime documente et le fichier de verrouillage."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/operations.md:17 092d6c8c824f4915ad5832b4ae982e86
msgid "Open an issue with secret-free evidence."
msgstr "Ouvrez une issue avec des preuves sans secret."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/operations.md:19 71eca397f42d438a8772caaa5fd69495
msgid "Security and privacy"
msgstr "Securite et vie privee"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/operations.md:21 07b485cec76e495da6e7d07b5d7405f3
msgid ""
"Candidate admission is a software decision trace, not proof of a physical or"
" quantum claim."
msgstr ""
"L'admission d'un candidat est une trace de decision logicielle, pas la "
"preuve d'une affirmation physique ou quantique."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/operations.md:23 15d1b21bcdcc4a269d5fd8e2d37b9a39
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "Contribuer"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/operations.md:25 2b4d83c79d7a42aa8d02425c93322a3a
msgid ""
"Read `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `SAFETY.md`, and the repository "
"license when present. Keep changes bounded and include the checks that "
"justify acceptance."
msgstr ""
"Lisez `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `SAFETY.md` et la licence du depot "
"lorsqu'ils existent. Gardez les changements bornes et incluez les controles "
"qui justifient leur acceptation."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/operations.md:27 3be8fdf8076c48ebb7bfee8c667a88f3
msgid "Releases"
msgstr "Versions publiees"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/operations.md:29 02d4a91c63134c4e9c37d8e9540beb92
msgid ""
"The current public documentation describes `0.1.0` with status `public-"
"preview`. Consult the repository history and release notes for changes."
msgstr ""
"La documentation publique actuelle decrit `0.1.0` avec le statut `public-"
"preview`. Consultez l'historique du depot et les notes de version pour les "
"changements."
